OL,3,GNEWSAThree friends on their student
OL,4,Adebt: One paid off, one chipping away
OL,5,Aand one creeping up
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Lizzy, Libby and Charlotte met as
OL,8,Ffreshers in 2012, their main
OL,9,Fresponsibility was making it to
OL,10,Flectures on time after early morning
OL,11,Fsports practice.
OL,13,FTheir student debt, growing with
OL,14,Finterest from the day they took out
OL,15,Ftheir loans, was the last thing on
OL,16,Ftheir minds.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
